---
/**
 * The first focusable thing on every page.
 *
 * Its target is the `<main id="content">` the shell itself renders, so the link
 * cannot go stale when a page family changes — there is exactly one main and the
 * shell owns it.
 *
 * Markup keeps normal capitalisation, and so does the rendering: the site sets
 * no `text-transform`. See the note in styles/reset.css for why the old
 * lowercase transform was wrong.
 */
---

<a class="skip-link" href="#content">Skip to content</a>
